Z||000000||WhiteFieroBlur||10-05-2001||01:44 PM||||Well I was just wondering if anyone has ever tried or thought about adding those grill inserts found on the front bumpers of kits in the opening we have on our front fieros. They look good on cars and thought it might make the fiero look better if done right. If I wanted to attempt this, do you have any ideas of how I could intall it if I buy the grill inserts?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Rick 88||10-05-2001||06:02 PM||||How about getting some of the mesh panels from the bottom of non-GT engine vents. That would be more than enough material to fill the opening. You could silicon it to the inside of the grill opening. Paint it silver to look like the "speed grills" out there.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Rick 88||||reg||3
